The event sites a mode listens on, each one call to amk_hook_fire with no mode logic: the
makefiles are read and the goal references settled, in main.c; a target failed, before the
deletion that a failed recipe and a fatal signal share, in job.c and commands.c; and an
imported target's job started, inside its fork before its output lands, in job.c.

